{# Ambient backdrop — glows + a woven texture + vignette. Included by
   list/detail/home pages, so restyling it here upgrades them all.

   The weave is the one piece of atmosphere CSS alone cannot theme, because the
   two identities need different GEOMETRY, not a different colour. Both patterns
   ship and the theme hides one: Piltover weaves hexagons (the hex crystal,
   drawn with a compass), Zaun weaves lattice ironwork — the ogee grille and
   whiplash stem of Art Nouveau metalwork, which is literally what its buildings
   are made of. A pattern whose <rect> is hidden is never rasterised, so the
   second one costs nothing to carry. #}
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="hx-ambient-glow--cyan hx-breathe absolute -top-1/3 left-1/2 h-[62rem] w-[62rem]
              rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="hx-ambient-glow--gold absolute right-0 top-1/4 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] rounded-full
              opacity-20 blur-3xl"></div>

  <svg class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.05]" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="hexweave" width="56" height="48" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M14 1 L42 1 L56 24 L42 47 L14 47 L0 24 Z"
              fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold)" stroke-width="1"/>
      </pattern>
      {# Ogee lattice: two half-arcs that continue into the neighbouring tile at
         mid-height so the grille runs unbroken, plus the whiplash stem COLLINS
         names as Zaun's signature curve. Tall tile — Zaun is read vertically. #}
      <pattern id="ironlattice" width="60" height="104" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <g fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold)" stroke-width="1">
          <path d="M30 0 C48 16 60 32 60 52 C60 72 48 88 30 104"/>
          <path d="M30 0 C12 16 0 32 0 52 C0 72 12 88 30 104"/>
          <path d="M30 20 C22 34 38 44 30 52 C22 60 38 70 30 84" opacity="0.7"/>
        </g>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect class="weave-hex" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#hexweave)"/>
    <rect class="weave-iron" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#ironlattice)"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="hx-ambient-vignette absolute inset-0"></div>
</div>
